["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Does the UK really have nine out of the ten poorest regions in Northern Europe? Purchasing Power Parity (PPP) GDP per head household disposable income telomere\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-moreorless-英国-十大最穷地区占九席-换个收入指标就只剩两席/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">30:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>英國「十大最窮地區佔九席」換個收入指標就只剩兩席</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用人均GDP衡量，英國確實佔了北歐十大最窮地區的九席；換成家庭可支配收入這個更貼近生活水平的指標，這個數字立刻掉到兩席。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">統計口徑</span><span class=\"tag\">地區差距</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"HoP 500b Melissa Lane on Herotodus and Thucydides historia autopsy nomos-physis debate rhetoric of anti-rhetoric Constitution of the Five Thousand\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-30-hopwag-那场雅典逼弱国就范的对话-被社区组织者读出了求生课而非霸权论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">43:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0930</span></div>\n<h2>那場雅典逼弱國就範的對話，被社區組織者讀出了求生課而非霸權論</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">修昔底德讓雅典人對米洛斯人說：正義只在實力相當的雙方之間才談得上，弱者的籌碼只剩「希望」；一群美國社區組織者讀到這段，覺得雅典人說得在理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古希臘史學</span><span class=\"tag\">修昔底德</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E254｜超級厄爾尼諾來了，我們的日常所需真會因它漲價嗎？ ONI IOD ENSO\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-sv101-厄尔尼诺不是全球涨价按钮-真正决定价格的是产区集中度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>厄爾尼諾不是全球漲價按鈕：真正決定價格的是產區集中度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同樣遭遇乾旱，集中在兩三個國家的棕櫚油、大豆價格應聲大漲，產區分散的水稻、小麥卻幾乎無感——厄爾尼諾傷不傷得到你的錢包，取決於貿易集中度而非氣候本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大宗商品</span><span class=\"tag\">厄爾尼諾</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Golden Goose Awards 2026: The Science Behind the Winners (Part 1) (EP 59) Histotripsy Cavitation Duty cycle Jamming Black Marble algorithm\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-fromfirstprinc-把肿瘤震碎而非烧掉-免疫系统才能认出残骸/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3248f02d6e6be9fe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">2:07:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>把腫瘤震碎而非燒掉，免疫系統才能認出殘骸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">聲波把腫瘤震碎而非燒化，細胞碎片留住腫瘤抗原，讓免疫系統學會識別並抑制身體其他部位的轉移灶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療器械</span><span class=\"tag\">精準醫學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Will AI take power — or will humans use it to take power first? With Katja Grace and Tom Davidson model spec warning shot intent alignment hedonium\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-eightythousand-人类独裁者掌权-结果可能比失控ai更糟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8483b66a7194429e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>人類獨裁者掌權，結果可能比失控AI更糟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">湯姆認為單個人類掌握絕對權力後，大概率會像歷史上的暴君一樣把某種狹隘價值鎖定為終局，而受過倫理訓練的AI在對齊的情況下反而更可能保持開放和反思。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI失控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Frank Furedi on the Case for Populism paradox of tolerance anti-pluralism spirit of populism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-goodfight-反民粹人士才是今天最不能容忍异见的人-民粹主义辩护者说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>反民粹人士才是今天最不能容忍異見的人——民粹主義辯護者說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的論據是：歐爾班執政十六年零封禁政黨、零驅散示威；反倒是布魯塞爾一場討論「保守派女性主義」的學術會議，被 Antifa 逼到要出動水炮才能開完。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民粹主義</span><span class=\"tag\">民主理論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Personal Agent Race Is Here | Anish Acharya &amp; David Pawlan narrow startups presumptuousness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-a16z-个人智能体真正的护城河不是人设-是敢替用户做主/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>個人智能體真正的護城河不是人設，是敢替用戶做主</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人格設定幾句話就能改，談不上壁壘；真正難複製的是主動性——智能體敢在多大程度上不經請示就替用戶把事辦了，這條線一旦越界會瞬間失去用戶信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">消費級AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Bill Ackman: The Biggest Fight of His Life AVM (arterial venous malformation) MPC (master planned community) float\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-knowledge-医生通常脑压迫超5小时就放弃手术-她被压了19小时才做手术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fce4e1a559b6e3b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>醫生通常腦壓迫超5小時就放棄手術，她被壓了19小時才做手術</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿克曼說醫生通常在腦內出血壓迫超過5小時後判定腦死亡而放棄手術，女兒被壓迫19小時，他仍要求醫生盡全力手術，如今她認知和幽默感基本恢復，語言、視力與行走仍在艱難恢復中。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">投資哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">AI顛覆風險</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"The neuroscience of resonance: How to use language to strengthen attachment with your child with Sarah Peyton resonance earned secure attachment vagus nerve alarmed aloneness Panksepp&#x27;s core emotion circuits nonviolent communication (NVC)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-secureattach-共情可以沉默-共鸣却必须开口确认/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">59:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>共情可以沉默，共鳴卻必須開口確認</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">共情是你獨自對孩子產生的感受，可以完全不說話；共鳴卻必須靠語氣和猜測反覆確認「我懂你嗎」，孩子說「不對」時，兩個人才算真正對上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依戀理論</span><span class=\"tag\">非暴力溝通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 223 ALS: Unraveling the mystery TDP-43 C9ORF72 penetrance bulbar onset / spinal onset upper motor neuron / lower motor neuron ALS Untangled\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-tpwky-冰桶挑战筹了2-2亿美元-als依然没有能治愈的药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>冰桶挑戰籌了2.2億美元，ALS依然沒有能治癒的藥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2014年那場冰桶挑戰讓近3000萬人捐款2.2億美元，但十多年後，唯一被廣泛批准的藥物利魯唑也只能把生存期平均延長三個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ALS</span><span class=\"tag\">漸凍症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"291: How Your Kid’s Exclusion Hurts You Too | Michelle Icard free-floating atom bellying up to the buffet\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-asklisa-孩子被朋友圈排挤-家长插手撮合反而把路堵死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42f1705a647f9db2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">30:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>孩子被朋友圈排擠，家長插手撮合反而把路堵死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當孩子被朋友圈排除在外時，家長想替她說和、找對方家長理論往往幫倒忙，更該做的是把自己的憤怒放到安全的地方，再問孩子想怎樣應對。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期教育</span><span class=\"tag\">社交排擠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Does This Stuff Actually Work? Parents Write Back primary attachment figure\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-unruffled-崩溃时不必哄不必转移注意力-说出那种难反而管用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">23:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>崩潰時不必哄不必轉移注意力，說出那種難反而管用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩位媽媽按同一條反直覺建議——把接送時的失落、過渡期的失控感直接說出來，而不是哄、轉移注意力或安撫——試了幾週後，孩子撞門撕咬式的崩潰和拔頭髮的自我安撫都明顯減少了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">分離焦慮</span><span class=\"tag\">情緒引導</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Obsolete or Irreplaceable? Garrison Lovely on Stopping the Race to Replace Human Labor enshittification RLHF RSI RLVR fast follow citizens&#x27; assemblies\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-cogrev-美国放缓ai竞速-拖慢的是中国而非把优势让出去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/10c1e8c45bb33c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:14:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>美國放緩AI競速，拖慢的是中國而非把優勢讓出去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國AI戰略是「快速跟隨」，落後美國前沿3到9個月；美國主動減速會讓整條賽道變慢，而不是把領先地位拱手讓給追隨者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Stop Trying to Make Your Kid Feel Good About Themselves\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-goodinside-自信不是感觉良好-而是难受时依然信任自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">19:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>自信不是感覺良好，而是難受時依然信任自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">父母急著修復孩子的難受、擺平結果、用外部認可安撫內心，這些出於愛的反射動作，恰恰在縮小孩子能安然做自己的範圍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">兒童心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"China&#x27;s Economy is Broken | Logan Wright LGFV shadow banking K-shaped economy involution 3-6-3\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-chinatalk-中国经济不是崩溃-而是主动选择了慢性衰败/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfbfe84346ee6490-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>中國經濟不是崩潰，而是主動選擇了慢性衰敗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者認為通向危機的從來不是外部衝擊，而是改革本身——所以北京寧可用增長換穩定，把一次金融危機拖成了看不到頭的慢性衰敗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中國經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">房地產</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"90.人形機器人為什麼執著於運動會？｜與天工熊友軍的訪談 VLA Ego World Model Unified Model Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-lightstar-无脸跑不是丑-是强化学习自己选出的最优解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d5f1bb7ad9fc86b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"衛\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">漫談Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>無臉跑不是醜，是強化學習自己選出的最優解</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">天工Omni為了跑得更快，自動放棄人類靠擺臂平衡的直覺，改用腰部扭動完成同樣功能——機器學到的解法未必好看，卻服從物理約束下的最優解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Daniel Ek: Life After Spotify, Broken Healthcare Incentives, Catching Disease Early &amp; AI&#x27;s Potential vertical integration open weight models unit economics\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-allin-美国医保不做预防-员工跳槽太快-没人等得起十年回报/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06d3963e882f0fac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">51:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>美國醫保不做預防：員工跳槽太快，沒人等得起十年回報</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">普通人平均兩三年換一次工作和保險，但預防性治療的回報要等十到二十年，沒有保險公司願意為未來跳槽到別家的客戶買單。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療科技</span><span class=\"tag\">Spotify</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Olaf Dreyer: This One Number Explains the Beginning quasinormal modes coherent state generalized rigidity space of vacua strong emergence\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-theoriesofever-凝聚态物理教材里的0-04-意外解释了宇宙微波背景的斜率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f318d0cff2e70451-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Theories of Everything with Curt Jaimungal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>凝聚態物理教材裡的0.04,意外解釋了宇宙微波背景的斜率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dreyer在一本凝聚態教材裡發現的0.04,和宇宙微波背景的譜指數完全對上，他因此認為宇宙誕生於一次相變，引力的根本對象不是度規，而是類似自旋方向的序參量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子引力</span><span class=\"tag\">弦論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Two Beer Riots Biersatz Reinheitsgebot gemütlichkeit mass Know-Nothings\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-stuffmissed-慕尼黑啤酒骚乱背后-是官方拒绝承认的失业与行会崩溃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>慕尼黑啤酒騷亂背後，是官方拒絕承認的失業與行會崩潰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1844年官方調查只歸咎於啤酒漲到六個半克羅採，卻迴避了學徒無出路、士兵被剋扣補貼、行會衰敗這些真正讓人憤怒的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">啤酒史</span><span class=\"tag\">巴伐利亞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Noah Shinn - Building Instinct: The Personal Agent - [Invest Like the Best, EP.493] trusted person network take rate proactivity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-ilt-个人智能体不会蚕食企业收入-摩擦越低-交易反而越多/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/574af85b07ae8e0c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>個人智能體不會蠶食企業收入：摩擦越低，交易反而越多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Instinct 創始人稱，把下單摩擦降到接近零後，用戶與商家的交易頻次不降反升——這與靠廣告位賺錢的舊模式完全相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">交易抽成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Can Write Code. Why Isn’t Software Better? RSI SaaSpocalypse 4GL probabilistic programming\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-a16z-ai编码工具写代码更快-但软件本身十年没怎么变聪明/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">43:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>AI編碼工具寫代碼更快，但軟件本身十年沒怎麼變聰明</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">編碼智能體讓人寫代碼更快，但產出的還是同一種軟件；Diogo Almeida說真正該做的是把AI變成軟件裡的新原語，讓此前不能自動化的事情變得可以自動化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI編程</span><span class=\"tag\">編碼智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"148 ✪ 吃好睡好：肯德基KPRO入局輕食、亞朵星球床品創新 Sleep Tech think out of the box\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-fengtouquan-酒店品牌亚朵卖枕头一年回本-这个窗口期已经关闭/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"瘋\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">瘋投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>酒店品牌亞朵賣枕頭一年回本：這個窗口期已經關閉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">五年前獲客成本只有今天的十分之一，亞朵靠賣枕頭一年回本全是那波紅利；今天華住重金砸同類業務，也追不上當年的起盤速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">輕食</span><span class=\"tag\">睡眠經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Building a Crosswalk in LA Is Kafkaesque ADU cap rate\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-oddlots-洛杉矶装一个人行横道-批文到手却要等好几年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">21:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>洛杉磯裝一個人行橫道：批文到手卻要等好幾年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開發商拿到人行橫道審批，得到的答覆卻是「幾年後或更久才建成」,報價隨口就是上百萬美元——這精確暴露出LA審批系統看著鬆散、實則處處卡殼的真相。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市規劃</span><span class=\"tag\">分區法規</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"#409 ‒ Inside modern drug development: the science, economics, and regulatory hurdles behind bringing new medicines to patients | Lloyd Klickstein, M.D., Ph.D. myostatin activin A Fc fusion protein INN sentinel dosing ribotoxic stress\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-thepeterattiad-被大厂放弃的增肌抗体-搭配减肥针后减脂效果追上了减重手术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>被大廠放棄的增肌抗體，搭配減肥針後減脂效果追上了減重手術</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這款曾被諾華放棄的增肌抗體，與司美格魯肽聯用72周後，體脂下降45.7%、體重下降22%-23%，是第一款減脂幅度追平減重手術的藥物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">藥物研發</span><span class=\"tag\">臨床試驗</span>\n</div></div></a>"]